Inspect bounded wrapper manifest references without claiming test-suite membership

Usage: xtask android-reference-class-path [OPTIONS] --jar <JAR>

Options:
      --jar <JAR>
          Wrapper JAR whose main manifest Class-Path is inspected
      --max-archive-bytes <MAX_ARCHIVE_BYTES>
          [default: 33554432]
      --max-manifest-bytes <MAX_MANIFEST_BYTES>
          [default: 1048576]
      --max-archive-entries <MAX_ARCHIVE_ENTRIES>
          [default: 4096]
      --max-references <MAX_REFERENCES>
          [default: 4096]
  -h, --help
          Print help
